assets/original_shader.blend contains the original editable node graphs converted
by Blender 5.2. All images and preview objects were removed; image nodes retain
the original reference names. assets/original_controls.blend contains the
original procedural lighting controls and head reference objects.
upstream_mapping.py extracts the original V3_MaterialDataApplier dictionaries.
tools/fetch_upstream.py, build_shader_library.py and build_upstream_mappings.py
describe how these assets and mappings are obtained and prepared. See
assets/upstream.json for input versions and SHA256 provenance.

Hoyo-GI-Toon adapts the current Blender API and scopes the original setup to each
imported character. It does not distribute game character models, textures,
material dumps or private validation projects. Local game assets are read from
the selected character package.
